1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,393
There's no blue pigment in blue eyes.

2
00:00:02,893 --> 00:00:06,507
Every eye colour comes from one brown pigment: melanin.

3
00:00:06,807 --> 00:00:10,228
Blue eyes have almost none in the front layer of the iris.

4
00:00:10,728 --> 00:00:14,271
Tiny fibres there scatter light, and blue scatters the most.

5
00:00:14,571 --> 00:00:16,681
The dark back layer soaks up the rest.

6
00:00:17,181 --> 00:00:20,055
Add a little melanin, and the eye looks green.

7
00:00:20,055 --> 00:00:21,055
Add more, brown.

8
00:00:21,555 --> 00:00:24,226
Blue eyes are blue the way the sky is blue.
